<title>USA: Fastenal Co to join Nasdaq 100 index.</title>
<headline>Fastenal Co to join Nasdaq 100 index.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nasdaq stock market said on Thursday it will add Fastenal Co to the Nasdaq 100 index as of December 31.</p>
<p>Fastenal, which sells threaded fasteners and other industrial and construction supplies, will replace MFS Communications Co Inc, Nasdaq said.</p>
<p>MFS is merging with WorldCom Inc.</p>
<p>The Nasdaq 100 is a capitalization-weighted index of the 100 largest non-financial Nasdaq stocks.</p>
</text>
